Service API Integration Guide\nInstant Order Fulfillment Guide\nTerms of Use\nTerms of Service\nData Protection Policy\nPlatform Partner Rules\nTW Developer Screening\nChatbot Terms of Service\nDeclare seus IPs\nIntroduction\nLast Updated: 2024-11-11\nLanguage Supported: English / 简体中文 / 繁體中文 / Português (Brasil) / ไทย\nWhat is Shopee Open Platform?\n\n\n\n\nCreated to support developers serving Shopee sellers with different ecommerce needs, Shopee Open Platform is your go-to source of Open APIs and services.\n\n\n\n\nPowerful APIs: Get access to a wide range of Open APIs with Shopee Open Platform, including those for orders, products, marketing and more. By tapping on Open API and push notification services released by Shopee, you can create customized software services to satisfy common seller needs such as order fulfillment, product optimization, shop promotion and more.\nComprehensive developer services: Enjoy end-to-end developer support at the stages of onboarding, APP development, APP testing, APP release, and APP maintenance. You can find tools for efficiency within the Shopee Open Platform to:\nManage your APPs\nAccess Open API testing tools, test accounts and sandbox testing environments\nGet important information such as the latest news (Announcement page), Open API articles (Documentation), answers to your queries (Support Center), and also search for articles.\nBenefits of using Shopee Open API?\n\n\n\n\nShopee Open API provides sellers with quick and easy access to important shop data for selling on Shopee. This includes information for product, order, and campaign management, amongst others. Available in all markets, Shopee Open Platform allows you to integrate a single set of Open APIs even if you sell or support sellers in more than one market.\n\nWho can access Shopee Open Platform?\n\n\n\n\nShopee Open Platform, specifically the Shopee Open Platform Console, caters to 2 types of developers, providing the most suitable solutions for each’s business needs:\n\nSoftware service providers: We offer a comprehensive range of Open APIs that cover all of Shopee’s key ecommerce processes for software businesses. By leveraging on Shopee Open Platform, you’ll be able to deliver a variety of APPs to meet sellers’ needs for shop operations, marketing, and more.\nSellers with software development capabilities: If you’re a seller who wants to develop software tailored to your business needs, integrate your systems with Shopee’s to discover untapped potential in the areas of operations optimization and data management.\nAPI integration overview\n\n\n\n\nHere’s a quick look at the steps you can take to get familiar with API integration on Shopee Open Platform before going live with your App:\n\nUser Guide\nDeveloper Guide\nAPI reference\nPush Mechanism\nShopee Open Platform Data Protection Policy\nShopee Markets\nService Market\nSeller Education Hub (Singapore)\nSeller Education Hub (Malaysia)\nSeller Education Hub (Thailand)\nSeller Education Hub (Vietnam)\nSeller Education Hub (Indonesia)\nSeller Education Hub (Philippines)\nSeller Education Hub (Brazil)\nSeller Education Hub (Japan)\nSeller Education Hub (Korea)\nSeller Education Hub (Hongkong)\n虾皮卖家学习中心\nSupport\nAnnouncement\nFAQ\nRaise Ticket\nCopyright @ Shopee 2025"
